# Stocking the Pantry: "Whenever you put one or more +1/+1 counters on a creature you control" (CR 122.6, 603.2c). Nothing
# counts when Bot1 puts a -1/-1 counter on its own Devoted Druid (not +1/+1), when Bot2's Honor puts one on Bot1's
# Ornithopter (not "you" put it), or when Bot1's own Honor puts one on Bot2's Ornithopter (not a creature you control). Bot1's
# Honor on its own Ornithopter is the one that puts a supply counter on it.

